**How many** of the following series are **conditionally** convergent?

$$
\sum_{k=2}^{\infty} \frac{(-1)^k}{k\ln k}
$$

$$
\sum_{k=1}^{\infty} \frac{(-1)^k}{\pi^k}
$$

$$
\sum_{k=1}^{\infty} \frac{(-1)^{k+1}}{k^{0.998}}
$$

$$
\sum_{k=1337}^{\infty} \frac{-1}{k^2}
$$

$$
\sum_{k=1}^{\infty} \frac{(-1)^k}{k^{\pi}}
$$
